 "contenido": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcR_4AW_PgNupSZl8GdswC5gRNn9oGrzMW_bhYP2uttHs8krZA\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcR_4AW_PgNupSZl8GdswC5gRNn9oGrzMW_bhYP2uttHs8krZA\" /></a><a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcR_4AW_PgNupSZl8GdswC5gRNn9oGrzMW_bhYP2uttHs8krZA\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: justify;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"0\" id=\"p-rc_4171a1eacabfa3be-25\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">Kondimenta</b><span class=\"citation-15\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"> (kondimenta-store.com) es una tienda online española especializada en la creación y venta de </span><b data-index-in-node=\"104\" data-path-to-node=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">mezclas de especias artesanales y 100% naturales</b><span class=\"citation-15 citation-end-15\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2928887237=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2928887237=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c2541936313=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2541936313=\"\" _nghost-ng-c598071169=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node=\"1\" id=\"p-rc_4171a1eacabfa3be-26\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span class=\"citation-14\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">El proyecto fue fundado por María y Jorge, dos apasionados de la gastronomía, y tiene su base y centro de producción artesanal en </span><b data-index-in-node=\"130\" data-path-to-node=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">Leioa, Bizkaia</b><span class=\"citation-14 citation-end-14\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"> (País Vasco).<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2928887237=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2928887237=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c2541936313=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"></sources-carousel-inline></p></a></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"tienda-catalogo\"></div>\n<div id=\"sentinel\" style=\"height: 1px;\"></div>\n<div id=\"loader\" style=\"display: none; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">Cargando productos, por favor espera...</div>\n\n<div id=\"web-oficial-container\" style=\"display: none; margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px 0px 40px; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://kondimenta-store.com/?utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&amp;utm_medium=boton_oficial&amp;utm_campaign=catalogo_kondimenta-store\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"background: rgb(17, 17, 17); border-radius: 6px; color: white; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 14px 36px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;\" target=\"_blank\">Ir a la web oficial</a>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n#tienda-catalogo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:20px;font-family:Arial;}\n.producto-card{border:1px solid #eaeaea;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;background:#fff;}\n.producto-card img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;}\n.producto-title{font-size:14px;margin:10px 0;font-weight:600;}\n.producto-link{display:block;background:#111;color:#fff;padding:10px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;}\n</style>\n\n<script>\nvar cargando = false;\nfunction crearTarjeta(p){\n  var sep = p.url.indexOf('?') !== -1 ? '&' : '?';\n  var utm = sep + 'utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&utm_medium=tarjeta_producto&utm_campaign=catalogo_kondimenta-store';\n  var urlConUtm = p.url + utm;\n  var urlClic = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbymjaZZpelLTpLoZ5t19Y_ppTRW0JH_qbOLxhUHANIH4Yk_OWzCkoXefdSRcQw3qRyu0Q/exec?producto=' + encodeURIComponent(p.titulo) + '&url=' + encodeURIComponent(p.url);\n  var h = '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-card' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>';\n  if(p.imagen) h += '<img src=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + p.imagen + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' loading=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'lazy' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' alt=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + p.titulo + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>';\n  h += '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-title' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>' + p.titulo + '</div>';\n  h += '<a class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-link' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' href=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + urlConUtm + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' rel=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'nofollow' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' target=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '_blank' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' onclick=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'fetch(' + String.fromCharCode(39) + urlClic + String.fromCharCode(39) + ',{mode:' + String.fromCharCode(39) + 'no-cors' + String.fromCharCode(39) + '})' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>Comprar ahora</a>';\n  h += '</div>';\n  return h;\n}\nvar hayMas = true;\nvar cola = false;\nvar paginaActual = 1;\nfunction cargarProductos(){\n  if(cargando || !hayMas) return;\n  cargando = true;\n  document.getElementById('loader').style.display = 'block';\n  fetch('https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxo5Q4FNyOpLE4qEDHgZVzdavmxZQMUhQmCak2RjWRNJqQI0uqxcqjgHp2y81mxznFg/exec?sitemap=https%3A%2F%2Fkondimenta-store.com%2Fsitemap_products_1.xml%3Ffrom%3D5715358417060%26to%3D10671767028045&pagina=' + paginaActual)\n    .then(function(r){ return r.json(); })\n    .then(function(data){\n      document.getElementById('tienda-catalogo').innerHTML += data.productos.map(crearTarjeta).join('');\n      hayMas = data.hayMas;\n      paginaActual++;\n      if(!hayMas) document.getElementById('web-oficial-container').style.display = 'block';\n      document.getElementById('loader').style.display = 'none';\n      cargando = false;\n      if(cola){ cola = false; cargarProductos(); }\n    })\n    .catch(function(err){ console.log(err); cargando = false; });\n}\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){\n  cargarProductos();\n  var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n    if(entries[0].isIntersecting){ if(cargando){ cola=true; return; } cargarProductos(); }\n  }, {rootMargin:'250px'});\n  observer.observe(document.getElementById('sentinel'));\n});\n\n</script>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n<a href=\"https://kondimenta-store.com/?utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&amp;utm_medium=enlace_texto_inferior&amp;utm_campaign=catalogo_kondimenta-store\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><b>IR A LA WEB OFICIAL</b></a>\n<div><br /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">SI EL PRODUCTO ESTÁ AGOTADO O NO ENVÍAN A TU DESTINO CONTÁCTANOS: <a href=\"mailto:comercialyventas@gmail.com\">comercialyventas@gmail.com</a></span></div>",
 "fecha_copia": "2026-09-26T16:59:56.130Z"
}